sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box rgba(21,101,192,0.04) Internal zone
    participant W as Engine worker
    participant AD as AgentAdapter (host)
    participant V as OutputSchemaValidator
    participant RE as RuleEngine (in-process)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (pre_*, rle_decision)
  end

  Note over W,DB: TX1 already committed: bounded inputs resolved, fields with mask true stored as HMAC in pre_history, lease held
  rect rgba(243,229,245,0.7)
    Note over W,AD: Outside any transaction
    W->>AD: execute(agent, inputs in clear, outputSchema id, attemptId, timeout)
    AD-->>W: raw output and latency
  end
  rect rgba(224,242,241,0.8)
    Note over W,DB: TX2, lease verified first
    W->>V: validate output against outputSchema
    alt schema invalid
      V-->>W: AGENT_SCHEMA_INVALID: counts as a failed attempt (retry or incident)
    else schema valid
      W->>RE: evaluate(guardrails.decision, output)
      RE->>DB: INSERT rle_decision (same transaction)
      alt allow = true
        RE-->>W: allow, decisionId
        W->>DB: history: output, guardrailDecisionId, latency then advance token
      else allow = false, or decision error (fail closed, reason GUARDRAIL_EVALUATION_ERROR)
        RE-->>W: allow false, reasons, matched rule ids
        alt onViolation route-to-human
          W->>DB: approval pre_task carrying inputs, output, reasons, matched rules then triggering identity in forbidden_users
        else onViolation fail
          W->>DB: pre_incident OPEN, or compensation when onFailure is compensate
        end
      end
    end
    W->>DB: COMMIT
  end
  Note over W,DB: A reviewer edit or rejection on the approval task is stored as human_override in pre_history
